Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:44.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:54.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:03.16,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:09.52,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:18.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:23.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:32.88,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:38.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.84,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:45.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:52.48,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:57.12,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:06.00,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.64,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The celestial spiritual energy fluctuations are intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be a celestial artifact inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I came here earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't see any formations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could such a massive formation appear here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Shengong arrived early !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,On my way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had the honor of meeting Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You met my Master ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior also gave some instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must be careful on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is indeed somewhat strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation broke too quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It broke !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation is open !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this thing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,back !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Run !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day of my rebirth !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:49.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1644,482)}Main fragment\NThunder Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will reach the Celestial Realm Gate in half a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we still haven't encountered a single person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:05:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,what's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this thing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of this arm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:27.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is close to Nirvana Scryer !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,can devour thunder !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't survive if it hits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to use my Third-Eye spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This battle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,was the most perilous one I have had
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,since I reached Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This severed arm is too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder the road was deserted...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This thing most likely killed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's more than one severed limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It gathers blood energy through slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's probably using this energy to reassemble its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,its true cultivation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:53.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,...is definitely beyond what we can deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:55.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,we must quickly leave the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:14.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1688,455)}White-haired old man
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing Shui, oh Qing Shui...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You really dismembered me alive back then
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and sealed me here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that after tens of thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,would still be here !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You didn't expect this, did you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:42.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was your seal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that shielded me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the collapse of the Celestial Realm back then !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,can smell some living people once again !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many Qi Refiners have come
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Thunder Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,They should allow me to recover my cultivation a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Move !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me through !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gate is open !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This way !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do Qi Refiners nowadays
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,have so little origin energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,is allowed to leave the Thunder Celestial Realm today !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's closing the Celestial Realm Gate !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:23.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,if the gate closes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,we'll all be trapped here !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow me to kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,A monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Run !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to flee now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we won't be able to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bland...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,so bland...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're all going to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Members of the Zhan Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,join my formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tang Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:44.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,face the enemy !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,would rather die fighting than live in submission !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Lu Family will not retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Zheng Family will not retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll die either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,so let's fight at full strength !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:04.59,Second,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.39,Second,,0,0,0,,fight him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Charge !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,How interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slash !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword strike
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lock the Origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trap the Soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kunji Cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:56.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,suppress !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compared to the strength of the Celestial Realm back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,laughably weak !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,all living beings in this realm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall become sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:33.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1651,495)}Avatars\NCelestial Spell
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man's cultivation is sky high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he acts with ruthless cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,perhaps we should retreat deeper into the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use all my knowledge to set up defensive restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:17.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can hold out until he leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is most likely an Ancient Celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hiding from him in the Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the same as waiting for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:52.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to clear the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you trust me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course I do !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,why are you asking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a spell that allows me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to merge with the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and vanish without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:13.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,please go ahead and use your spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Li Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,am willing to take this gamble !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ordinary Spatial Bending won't be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to deceive this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must completely merge my body
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao has no form,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,clear the mind and the soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,return to the origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao of merging with the world ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even back in the days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,only a handful of people
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,could master such a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Show yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,before me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are the Qi Refiner
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,who escaped from my Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 100,0:19:23.96,0:21:58.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}“Celestial Lord Qing Shui, no matter how strong your seal was, it couldn’t beat the passage of time. You wouldn’t dare to kill me.\NIf you wanted to kill me, why did you place a healing formation outside the sealing formation!? However, I have to thank you, because if you had not sealed me, I fear I wouldn’t have survived the collapse of the Celestial Realm!\N“Qing Shui, since I didn’t die, you naturally aren’t dead either. Unless you can find another sealing vortex left behind by the Ancient Celestial Realm, you will not seal me again!” The white-haired man had a ferocious expression as he laughed wildly and charged into the void.\N\NAs the fragment collapsed, a monstrous flame shot out from within. There was a flash of red light and then an eye flew out. The person grabbed the eye and placed it inside his right eye socket.\N\N“The Ji Realm was sealed into the right eye, but too much of it was consumed back in the Celestial Realm War. It will be very difficult to replenish it, but it is not impossible! However, I have just escaped, so my cultivation is only at 10%. I must restore my celestial origin energy as soon as possible.”\N-----\NThe reason Wang Lin asks Li Yuan if he trusts him is because he isn't sure if he can use Spatial Bending to transport someone else safely.\N\NLi Yuan was startled and nodded. “Does Brother Xu have a method of leaving? I naturally believe in Brother Xu!”\N\NWang Lin hesitated before slowly saying, “I indeed have a spell, but I have not fully mastered it yet. If I take a person with me, while it won't harm me, the person I bring will likely suffer. If you agree, I can try it.”
